    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "――そンで、言い伝えられるようになった\r\nらしいンです。その旅館に泊まって\n座敷わらしに会えると、幸せになるって。",
            "enText": "So that's how the legend got started. \nThey say that seein' the <i>zashiki-warashi</i> \nat the inn is a good omen.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "pathId": -2610745780735457551,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ウイニングチケット",
            "enName": "Winning Ticket",
            "jpText": "そうなんだぁ……！\nいいね、なんか素敵な話だねっ！！",
            "enText": "Is that so? What an interesting story!",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "pathId": -2453931510984705439,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "ユキノさんは……あまり怖がらずに、\nそういった話を……されますね。",
            "enText": "Yukino… that doesn't scare you at all?",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "pathId": 8080715345929875041,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "ですかね？　うちの田舎じゃ、イノシシだの\nシカだのの方がよっぽど怖かったンで～。",
            "enText": "Not really? The wild boar and deer are much \nmore of a problem in ma hometown.",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "pathId": -8256974817738146953,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "あと……むかーしからある山や川や木が\nすぐそばにあったからか、こう……\n不思議なことも、そばにあったンです。",
            "enText": "And there's so many rivers an' trees \nthat've been there for who knows \nhow long. Maybe I've always been \nclose to some strange things.",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "pathId": 5709058020974411464,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "大自然の中の、神秘……ですね。\n……素敵な話だと、思います。",
            "enText": "So mysterious presences in the great swath \nof nature… That sounds great.",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "pathId": -706738223410923771,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ウイニングチケット",
            "enName": "Winning Ticket",
            "jpText": "ダイシゼン！　うんうんっ、ユキちゃんは\r\nそーいうのと仲良しそうな感じするよっ！",
            "enText": "Friends with nature? Sounds like Yuki \nfor sure!",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "pathId": 175285395329273458,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ウイニングチケット",
            "enName": "Winning Ticket",
            "jpText": "昨日もさ、学園裏の森で一緒にいたもんね！\r\n白い子猫ちゃん、くっつけて歩いてさ～！",
            "enText": "Just yesterday, I saw her in the woods behind\nthe academy, walking with a whole bunch of\nwhite kittens!",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "pathId": -5463272287060382629,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ユキノビジン",
            "enName": "Yukino Bijin",
            "jpText": "へ？　……あたし、昨日は1人で\nランニングしてただけですけど……。",
            "enText": "Hm? I mean, I was just runnin' \nby mahself yesterday…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "pathId": -204735458583105248,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ウイニングチケット",
            "enName": "Winning Ticket",
            "jpText": "えっ？",
            "enText": "Huh?",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "pathId": 4242549016300251514,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "マンハッタンカフェ",
            "enName": "Manhattan Cafe",
            "jpText": "……チケットさん。\nなぜ、気づいて……？",
            "enText": "Ticket, are you sure…",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "pathId": 3266786994046385674,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "ウイニングチケット",
            "enName": "Winning Ticket",
            "jpText": "えっ。……えっ！？",
            "enText": "Huh? <i>Huuuh?!</i>",
            "nextBlock": -1,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "pathId": 4526591834690194996,
            "blockIdx": 12
        }
    ],
